            "question": "What sizes do you offer?",
            "answer": "<p>Four standard sizes — balcony, patio, raised garden, and privacy — plus commercial project quotes and made-to-measure custom builds. Standard sizes start at 24″ for patio planters and go up to 60″ for privacy planters.</p>"
