          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you build custom sizes?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Custom is one of the things we do best. Send us the length, width, and height you need — plus a photo of the space if you have one — and we’ll come back with a sketch, quote, and timeline within 1–2 business days.</p>"
