          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What wood do you use?",
            "answer": "<p>Kiln-dried Western Cedar, locally sourced. Western Cedar is naturally rot-resistant, contains natural oils that repel insects, and ages beautifully in our wet climate.</p>"
