            "answer": "<p>Yes. We deliver across North Vancouver, West Vancouver, Vancouver, Burnaby, Richmond, Coquitlam, Port Coquitlam, Port Moody, New Westminster, Surrey, Delta, and Langley. Free pickup by appointment in North Vancouver. Local delivery: CAD $25.</p>"
